# Contact form delivery (Web3Forms)
#
# Get a key: https://web3forms.com/#start  ->  enter deshank962@gmail.com
# They email you an Access Key; paste it below, then copy this file to
# `.env.local` (which is gitignored).
#
# This is a public submit token by design: it only permits posting to your one
# form, so it is safe to expose in a static build. That is why the key is also
# committed as the default in src/components/Contact.tsx — it keeps GitHub Pages
# builds working without configuring any repository secret.
#
# Setting it here overrides that default for local development.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
